  <h2>Assign future months</h2>
  <p>Use the month arrows to plan ahead or look back. Each month has its own assigned amounts. Money still available in a category carries forward to the next month when the current month ends.</p>
  <p>After this month’s categories are covered, assign what is left to future months. When six months ahead are fully assigned, you have six months of budgeted spending. You are no longer living paycheck to paycheck.</p>
  <p>Targets let you use <strong>Auto-Assign</strong> to fill later months more quickly. See <a href="/guides/targets/">Targets</a>.</p>
